# Save compatibility: Welcome back. Closing the dialog with × does the default, "Start fresh from
# today": both missed coupons are skipped without paying them.
name welcome back: × starts fresh
issue-bond 1 1000
away 14
expect-welcome-back shown
welcome-back close
expect-welcome-back hidden
expect-bond-coupons 2
expect-log bonds: welcome back after 14 day(s) away: started fresh (0 payment(s) moved)
cleanup:
redeem-new-bonds
